WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.767
-Unwind your mind
as we journey deep

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:05.968
into the mystic forest realm
to discover...

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:13.501
♪♪

00:00:13.501 --> 00:00:15.834
-Hello! I'm Goat Leg Greg!

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:18.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:23.033
And this is "Pearls of Wisdom
with Goat Leg Greg."

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.634
Gilvin of the Tree,
show yourself!

00:00:25.634 --> 00:00:27.234
-'Tis I!

00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:29.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:32.834
[ Recorder plays ]

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:35.067
Gilvin of the Tree!

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:36.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:40.334
Commence thy pearls, Greg!

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:46.334
Enlighten us with your thoughts
about "The Bachelor"!

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:48.434
[ Recorder plays ]

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:52.367
-There's 30 young ladies,
15 are named Katie,

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:54.601
all searching for Mr. Right.

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:58.267
I watched the first few
but slept halfway through.

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:00.467
'Cause Zach is boring
as [bleep].

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.067
[ Recorder plays ]

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:03.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:04.968
-[ Giggling ]

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:07.634
That's a good one, Greg!

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:11.501
The truth is what thou speaketh!

00:01:11.501 --> 00:01:13.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.434 --> 00:01:16.901
[ Recorder plays ]

00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:21.634
Now delight us
with your brilliant take

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:25.334
on that which we call...

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:26.767
spring break!

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:29.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.901
[ Applause ]

00:01:30.901 --> 00:01:34.000
[ Recorder plays ]

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.501
-Spring break is here.
It's that time of year.

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:40.033
A week full of fun
and debauchery.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:44.367
If you make a love connection,
you best use protection,

00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:46.868
or you'll get a rash
down in your de-crotch-ery.

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:50.000
[ Recorder plays ]

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.033
-[ Giggling ]
That's a classic, Greg!

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:57.934
You speaketh what the rest of us
merely doth thinketh.

00:01:57.934 --> 00:01:59.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:00.934
[ Recorder plays ]

00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:03.067
You're the real GOAT.

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:06.033
Greatest of All Time
Topical Talker.

00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:08.100
Now...opine --

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:09.234
[Bleep]

00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:11.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:13.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:16.367
♪♪

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:22.033
Now opine, if you will,
about Shamrock Shakes!

00:02:22.033 --> 00:02:26.267
[ Recorder plays ]

00:02:26.267 --> 00:02:29.200
-Shamrock Shake, Shamrock Shake.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.634
Oh, how it quenches me thirst.

00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:33.534
It's green and bright

00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:36.467
but looks just like
Baby Yoda got the squirts!

00:02:36.467 --> 00:02:38.334
[ Recorder plays ]

00:02:38.334 --> 00:02:40.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:43.400
-You know it to be true, Greg!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:47.868
Oh, how your words
tickle the tongue

00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:51.167
with the titillating tales...

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:55.100
of tantalizingly torrid
totally toads!

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:58.167
Bravo, Greg! Bravo, I say!
Ha ha ha!

00:02:58.167 --> 00:02:59.367
Bravo to you!

00:02:59.367 --> 00:03:01.300
-Gilvin, Gilvin, enough!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:05.901
It is time for my final pearl.

00:03:05.901 --> 00:03:07.434
-Ooh! [ Giggles ]

00:03:07.434 --> 00:03:09.334
[ Recorder plays ]

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:12.067
The final pearl!
The final pearl!

00:03:12.067 --> 00:03:14.367
[ Recorder plays ]

00:03:14.367 --> 00:03:16.501
Commence thy final pearl, Greg!

00:03:16.501 --> 00:03:19.567
Oh, do one about
the Cocaine Bear.

00:03:19.567 --> 00:03:21.934
[ Recorder plays ]

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:24.834
-There once was a bear
on cocaine.

00:03:24.834 --> 00:03:27.834
The forest creatures
thought him insane.

00:03:27.834 --> 00:03:30.567
So he quit coke right there,
met Smokey the Bear,

00:03:30.567 --> 00:03:32.634
and lit up some sweet mary jane!

00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:35.400
[ Recorder plays ]

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:38.267
-That was it! That was it!
That's the one!

00:03:38.267 --> 00:03:40.133
You did it, Greg!
Ha ha ha!

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:41.767
[ Recorder plays ]

00:03:41.767 --> 00:03:45.100
-Farewell, Gilvin!
Farewell, Gilvin!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.300
And farewell --

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.467
-Aah!

00:03:47.467 --> 00:03:52.434
-Gilvin. Gilvin.
Are you alright? Gilvin?

00:03:52.434 --> 00:03:53.567
Gilvin, are you --

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:54.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:55.734
Gilvin?

00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:57.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.133
Are you alright?

00:03:59.133 --> 00:04:00.667
Farewell to you all!

00:04:00.667 --> 00:04:04.400
This has been "Pearls of Wisdom
with Goat Leg Greg."

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.334
Stick around.
We'll be right back.

00:04:06.334 --> 00:04:09.100
We're talking to Brendan Fraser.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:11.467 --> 00:04:16.467
♪♪

